  "comment": "Apple's Developer Disk Images the app ships for Tweaks' Developer Settings: one per iOS minor version from 4.2 to 7.1, as Xcode's DeviceSupport folders had them. scripts/vendor fetches each by its SHA-256 into Resources/Device/DeveloperDiskImages/<minor>/ (LightTouchCore DeveloperDiskImage picks the device's). The source is xushuduo/Xcode-iOS-Developer-Disk-Image at commit e47f568294b21df71fa1d4cfbe47758e3f44e9d2. 4.2 to 7.0 are byte for byte the images in Xcode 4.6.3 and 5.1.1 (archive.org xcode_old_versions, their SHA-1 checked, 2026-10-05); 7.1 is Xcode 5.1's (5.1.1's 7.1 (11D167) differs), checked by mounting it on 7.1.2. They are already compressed (UDZO): 57 MB together.",
